{{!--
« En bref » for visitors (post context): the summary itself is the author's HTML card
<ol class="en-bref"> in the content, shown to members only; a visitor sees this teaser instead, and only
when the post has such a card (CSS :has()). Not rendered when the theme setting summary_for_visitors is on.
The two buttons (« S'abonner », « Se connecter ») share one lookup of the subscription page
(subscribe-href.hbs), unless the setting subscribe_url gives it.
--}}
{{#unless @member}}{{#unless @custom.summary_for_visitors}}
  {{#if @custom.subscribe_url}}
    {{> article/summary-teaser-body}}
  {{else}}
    {{#get "pages" filter="slug:[newsletter,abonnement,subscribe]" limit="1" as |subscribepages|}}
      {{> article/summary-teaser-body subscribePages=subscribepages subscribePagesKnown=true}}
    {{else}}
      {{> article/summary-teaser-body}}
    {{/get}}
  {{/if}}
{{/unless}}{{/unless}}
